      "detailed_description": "Vitya and Volodya are two best friends who are faced with all sorts of problems, the main one of which is eviction from the apartment for non-payment. Friends do not have enough money and they decide to look for treasure, in parallel doing their daily activities. Many adventures and new unexpected meetings await them. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nLeague of Enthusiastic Losers is a reflective adventure game about experiencing yourself, looking for happiness, self-care, and not giving up contrary to what others think. Immerse yourself in a slow-flowing but true story, of the nostalgic journey to the 90s.",
